      "treatment_summary": "L-thyroxine replacement for autoimmune thyroiditis; blood transfusion, IV immunoglobulin and glucocorticoids for hemolytic anemia and its relapses, rituximab (January 2015); immunoglobulin replacement (ongoing) for post-rituximab hypogammaglobulinemia; intra-articular glucocorticoids and methotrexate for polyarthritis, etanercept added at 17 with good response; methotrexate and hydroxychloroquine ongoing at time of sampling.",
      "disease_label_as_stated": "HA20 (A20 haplo-insufficiency)",
      "clinical_diagnosis_basis": "Trio-based whole-exome sequencing (Pt1 and her parents) identified heterozygous TNFAIP3 c.1727dupC (p.His577Alafs*95); functional analyses (A20 expression, NF-kB p65 phosphorylation, cytokine and IFNγ-pathway studies).",
